@startuml
title Teacher Control Layout - Activity Control Sequence
actor Teacher
participant "Teacher Interface" as UI
participant "Activity" as Activity
Teacher -> UI : select 「開始答題」
UI -> Activity : start answering
Activity --> UI : answering state
UI --> Teacher : hide join/start; show end at former join position
UI --> Teacher : show progress tiles in four quarter-width slots per row
Teacher -> UI : select 「結束答題」
UI -> Activity : end answering
Activity --> UI : ended state
UI --> Teacher : keep end visible and unavailable
@enduml
